{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Port Shipping Tycoon Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling adventure as you build your own shipping empire in this addictive tile-flipping game! With just one click, start constructing your port business by flipping tiles to supply resources to bustling ports around the world.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/extras/port-shipping-tycoon.gif?t=1745490227\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and connect ports with shipping lines to create a vast network of trade routes<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/extras/3.png?t=1745490227\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage resources, optimize logistics, and keep your ships sailing smoothly.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/extras/2.png?t=1745490227\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in your preferred language. Supported languages: <strong>English, Korean, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese,</strong> and <strong>Simplified Chinese</strong>.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/extras/language.png?t=1745490227\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoyed the demo, please support us by buying the full game. We're still finishing up the final touches, and we would appreciate a wishlist from you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650530?t=1745490227","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650530?t=1745490227","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/c2057408ea7ecf00a78b4eacdf0850c4f5632bff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745490227","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/c2057408ea7ecf00a78b4eacdf0850c4f5632bff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745490227","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Port Shipping Tycoon Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling adventure as you build your own shipping empire in this addictive tile-flipping game! With just one click, start constructing your port business by flipping tiles to supply resources to bustling ports around the world.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/extras/port-shipping-tycoon.gif?t=1745490227\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and connect ports with shipping lines to create a vast network of trade routes<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/extras/3.png?t=1745490227\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage resources, optimize logistics, and keep your ships sailing smoothly.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/extras/2.png?t=1745490227\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in your preferred language. Supported languages: <strong>English, Korean, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese,</strong> and <strong>Simplified Chinese</strong>.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650530/extras/language.png?t=1745490227\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoyed the demo, please support us by buying the full game. We're still finishing up the final touches, and we would appreciate a wishlist fr